{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061481/block/singleImage/3254984/df/1489409559_hb.JPG?updatedAt=1793585581\"/><figcaption>將軍澳醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>西貢清水灣發生遇溺案。 今日（2日）早上7時18分，一名69歲老婦與丈夫一同前往西貢清水灣二灘游早水，其後被其他泳客發現她倒臥岸邊，昏迷不醒，連忙報警求助。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，由救護車將老婦送往將軍澳醫院搶救，可惜延至早上9時36分不治。警方將案件列「遇溺」調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:41:21.590865+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T02:13:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.795555+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T03:38:11.591726+00:00","content_hash":"53fb5b43071dd042436fe361c5a0f054818cf676d9f9ec06cdedba5b22b8cdc7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:41:21.590865+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}